#~ "<b>All Stencils</b><br>\n"
#~ "This will cause the entire page to be exported to the file. This means "
#~ "that <i>all</i> stencils will be exported."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "<b>Sve maske</b><br>\n"
#~ "Ovim će cijela strana biti izvezena u datoteku. To znači da će <i>sve</i> "
